
1. The Mysterious Door
One day, I was cleaning my room when I found a small key under my bed. I had never seen it before. I looked around and wondered what it could open.

First, I tried it on my cupboard, but it didn't work. Then I noticed a small door behind an old bookshelf. I put the key into the lock and slowly opened the door.

Suddenly, I saw a beautiful garden. There were colorful flowers, green trees, and a small river. I felt very happy and surprised.

I walked inside and enjoyed the beautiful place. After some time, I decided to return home. But when I turned around, the door had disappeared.

I became scared and started looking for another way out. Finally, I woke up and realized it was just a dream.

In the end, I learned that imagination can take us to wonderful places.

2. The Day I Became Invisible
One morning, I woke up and noticed something strange. I couldn't see my hands. I looked in the mirror, but my whole body had disappeared.

At first, I was very scared. Then I understood that I had become invisible. I decided to test my new power.

First, I went outside and walked through the market. Nobody could see me. Then I visited my friend's house and secretly ate his chocolate.

After some time, I started enjoying my power too much. I played tricks on people and made them confused.

Suddenly, I heard a strange voice saying, "Power is not for fun. It is for helping others."

I felt ashamed of my behavior. I decided to use my power to help people instead of troubling them.

In the end, I learned that every special power comes with responsibility.

3. A Strange Phone Call
One night, I was sitting alone in my room and using my phone. Suddenly, I received a call from an unknown number.

I picked up the call and said, "Hello, who is speaking?"

A strange voice replied, "I am calling from the future. You need to listen carefully."

I laughed because I thought someone was playing a joke on me. But the person told me exactly what I would do the next morning.

The next day, everything happened exactly as the voice had said. I became shocked and wanted to know more.

That night, the same number called me again. This time, the voice said, "Don't waste your time. Your future depends on your actions today."

After hearing this, I started thinking seriously about my life.

In the end, I learned that we cannot change our past, but we can build a better future through our actions.

4. The Poor Man and the Rich Man
One day, a rich man was walking through a market. He saw a poor old man sitting beside the road and asking for help.

The rich man looked at him and ignored him. He thought that helping poor people was a waste of money.

After some time, the rich man lost his wallet. He searched everywhere but couldn't find it.

Suddenly, the same poor old man came towards him and returned his wallet. The rich man was surprised.

He asked, "Why did you return my wallet? There was a lot of money inside."

The old man smiled and said, "Because my poverty cannot take away my honesty."

The rich man felt ashamed. He thanked the old man and gave him some money to help him.

In the end, he learned that a person's value is not decided by money but by character.

5. If I Could Travel Through Time
One day, I was sitting in my room and thinking about my life. Suddenly, I found a strange machine in an old box.

There was a button on it that said "Time Travel." I became excited and pressed the button.

In a few seconds, I reached the year 2050. Everything looked different. There were flying cars, smart robots, and beautiful buildings.

First, I visited a shopping mall where robots were helping people. Then I saw people travelling in flying vehicles.

I was enjoying everything when suddenly the machine started making a strange noise. I became worried because I didn't know how to return.

I quickly pressed the red button, and within seconds, I was back in my room.

I felt relaxed and happy. I understood that the future could be amazing, but the present was also important.

In the end, I learned that we should enjoy today while preparing for tomorrow
